        "e:": "[zh]存在元规则：[dname]e:规则[/dname] 给规则的条件与结论都加上存在量词。用于存在量词推理。[en]Existential metarule: [dname]e:rule[/dname] prefixes conditions and conclusion with an existential quantifier.",
